  ('Brisk walk', 'brisk_walk_moderate', 'walking', 't1_early', 't3_late', array['aerobic']::text[], '{}'::text[], array['overheating_risk']::text[], 'Pace where you can talk but not sing. 20-30 min. Water before, during, after.', 'Shorten to 10 min. Split into two walks. Move indoors if it''s hot or humid.', 'SOGC/CSEP 2019 Rec 2 - talk test / SOGC/CSEP 2019 Box 1 - avoid excessive heat/humidity; hydrate', 'The single most studied activity in pregnancy. Reduces the odds of gestational diabetes, pre-eclampsia, and high blood pressure. No equipment, no learning curve.', null),
