  ('Wall push-up', 'wall_pushup', 'strength', 't1_early', 't3_late', array['chest', 'shoulders']::text[], array['wall']::text[], '{}'::text[], 'Hands on wall shoulder-height. Body in one line. Lower with control, press away. 10-15.', 'Step closer to the wall to make it easier. Incline on a counter to make it harder.', 'SOGC/CSEP 2019 Rec 4 - aerobic + resistance, high-quality evidence', 'Upper body strength without lying down or loading the belly. Scales in both directions just by moving your feet.', null),
  ('Bird dog', 'bird_dog', 'strength', 't1_early', 't3_late', array['core', 'posterior_chain']::text[], '{}'::text[], array['coning_risk']::text[], 'Quadruped. Extend opposite arm and leg, keep hips level. 5 each side. Stop if the belly cones.', 'Extend only the leg, or only the arm. Reduce the range.', 'SOGC/CSEP 2019 impl. - diastasis: avoid abdominal curls', 'Trains deep core control without curling the spine, which is the kind of core work that stays appropriate as the belly grows.', null),
  ('Glute bridge', 'glute_bridge', 'strength', 't1_early', 't3_late', array['glutes', 'posterior_chain']::text[], '{}'::text[], array['supine']::text[], 'On the back, feet flat. Exhale, press through heels, lift hips. Lower slowly. 10-12.', 'If you feel light-headed, nauseous or unwell on your back, switch to the side-lying clamshell.', 'SOGC/CSEP 2019 Rec 6 - supine is SYMPTOM-triggered, not calendar', 'Strong glutes carry load the low back would otherwise take. One of the highest-value movements for pregnancy back pain.', null),
  ('Side-lying clamshell', 'side_lying_clamshell', 'strength', 't1_early', 't3_late', array['glutes', 'hips']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], 'On your side, knees bent and stacked. Lift the top knee without rolling the hips back. 12 each side.', 'Add a band above the knees to progress. Reduce range if the hip pinches.', 'SOGC/CSEP 2019 Rec 4 - aerobic + resistance, high-quality evidence', 'Targets the side glutes that stabilise the pelvis. Directly relevant to the hip and pelvic girdle pain that often shows up later.', null),
