  ('Warm-up and cool-down', 'warmup_cooldown_general', 'education', 't1_early', 't3_late', array['education']::text[], '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], 'Include both in every session. Ligaments loosen in pregnancy, which changes range of motion and raises injury risk.', 'Five minutes of easy walking counts as either.', 'SOGC/CSEP 2019 impl. - ligament laxity, warm-up/cool-down suggested', 'Pregnancy hormones loosen ligaments, so joints move further than they used to and injury risk goes up. A few easy minutes at each end is genuine protection.', null),
